A||||19||wkayl||Anthony Barber Benefit info...||||1||
Z||000000||wkayl||01-11-2001||11:55 PM||||Hello everyone.<P>Mrfiero and I had the opportunity to visit with Anthony's parents today.  We visited with his dad for almost an hour, his mom joining us the last 15 minutes.  They couldn't say enough nice things about the folks here on the Forum.  The first flowers to arrive in his room were from us.  His dad said he perked up considerably when he heard whom they were from.  His dad read the card on the flowers.  It said "from the Fiero Gang".   He asked him when he joined a "gang"?  <P>The Fiero he was driving was an 84.  They have owned it since 1990.  His dad used to drive a Fiero also but now drives an (can I say it?) MR2.  We had to rib him about that.  <P>As far as visiting with Anthony, he was resting while we were there and didn't get a chance.  We told his parents we would stop back in a week or so.  He will be transferring to a different hospital in a few days.  His dad says he looks remarkable considering the condition of his car.  Contrary to news reports, he was wearing his seat belt.<P>Now the good stuff.  I opened an account today for donations.  Here is where to send them;<P>1st Bank of Northern Colorado<BR>Anthony Barber Benefit<BR>% Wayne Kayl<BR>1352 West Eisenhower Boulevard<BR>Loveland, CO 80539<P>Make the checks payable to;<P>1st Bank/Wayne Kayl<P>with    "Anthony Barber Benefit "  in the memo line.<P>If any electronic transfers are needed, check with your bank as to the procedure.  E-mail me if you have any questions at wkayl717@aol.com<P>I have deposited some money to activate the account.  The statements I get from the bank will have only the amount of the deposit, not who they were from.  You can send as little or as much as you would like, no one will know.  It is a free account for 1 year.  I will create a web page and scan in the statements each month so everyone can see the progress of deposits and withdraws.  I left it up to his parents as to how and when the money will be released.  <P>Please let me know if you have any questions.  <P>Wayne R Kayl<BR>Loveland, CO<BR>||||reg||1
